{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44956","headline":"寓兴 · 皎然","name":"寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下生白榆，白榆直上连天根。\n高枝不知几万丈，世人仰望徒攀援。\n谁能上天采其子，种向人间笑桃李。\n因问老仙求种法，老仙咍我愚不答。\n始知此道无所成，还如瞽夫学长生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}